# RUNTIME-NOT: staged frame
# RUNTIME:     mdrt: {{.*}} failed with CUDA_ERROR_LAUNCH_FAILED
# RUNTIME-NEXT: mdrt: the last kernel launched was
# RUNTIME-NOT: staged frame
# ONCE: {{^1$}}
# TWO: 2 frames, 2 in the header, the first of the reference
# WAIT: mdrt: cuEventSynchronize of a staged frame failed with CUDA_ERROR_LAUNCH_FAILED
# COPY: mdrt: cuEventSynchronize (MDIR_FRAME_COPY_FAIL) of a staged frame failed with CUDA_ERROR_LAUNCH_FAILED
# STOP: INFO: 70 
# EARLIER-NOT: the particles spread {{[0-9]}}
# EARLIER: mdrt: cuEventSynchronize (MDIR_FRAME_COPY_FAIL) of a staged frame failed with CUDA_ERROR_LAUNCH_FAILED
